Location: Jakarta, Indonesia.

Source: Resume Ariell.docx, supplied by the portfolio owner. Employment status, dates, metrics, and achievements below are as stated in that resume; its “Now” date has not been independently reconfirmed.

## Employment

### Software Engineer — Samsung R&D Institute Indonesia

Jakarta, Jun 2023 - Present (as stated in the supplied resume)

- Developed Smartthings Console Management System website with ReactJS and ReactTS frontend.

- Developed Smartthings B2B Internal website with NextJS and NextTS frontend.

- Developed Venue Management System feature to improve retail store experience.

- Developed Dashboard Services to visualize data of activities in the Smartthings CMS Website.

- Implemented recursive UI components to dynamically generate forms from data-driven configurations, enabling automated form synchronization.

- Built unit tests to ensure the correctness of the product and reached 100% code coverage.

- Led end-to-end development of the "How to Use" menu webview in the SmartThings app, delivering searchable and filterable content to improve user accessibility and engagement.

- Owned the end-to-end development and evolution of SWUIF, Samsung’s internal UI component library, defining architecture, component standards, and best practices to support organization-wide UI consistency.

- Passed Samsung''s globally standardized problem-solving test at the PRO level in the company''s Software Engineer Certification program, achieved by only 30% of engineers.

- Employee of The Quarter Q3 2025

Tech Stack: Javascript, Typescript, React, Sonar, Keycloak, PostgreSQL, Ant design, Axios, Sbaas (Internal Java-based backend framework), Next, Jest, Docker, Countly, Airflow, AWS S3, Springboot, Vite, NodeJS, GraphQL, AWS Bedrock

### Software Engineer — Dekoruma

Jakarta/Remote, Mar 2022 - Mar 2023

- Built interior design services with RESTful APIs that served data and Javascript front-end based on dynamically chosen user input.

- Restructured product categorization to improve user experience.

- Revamped voucher appearance and improved the amount of user that use vouchers on their checkout page.

