### Software Engineering Intern — GLAIR

Jakarta/Remote, Jul 2021 - Sep 2021

- Explored Infrastructure as Code (IaC) and Serverless Application using Terraform, AWS CDK, and AWS Lambda.

- Built a website that counts URL visitors using IaC and Serverless concepts as a result of the internship.

- Showcased the result of the research to the whole company''s engineers to give insight for future improvement.

Tech Stack: Terraform, AWS CDK, AWS Lambda, Python.

### Software Engineering Intern — GDP Labs

Jakarta, Jan 2019 - Feb 2019

- Explored and researched Apache Flink as a data streaming framework.

- Improved already implemented Apache Kafka with Apache Flink as a data streaming framework.

- Showcased the result of the research to the whole company''s engineers to give insight for future improvement.

Tech Stack: Java, Apache Flink

## Education

### Bachelor of Computer Science — Universitas Indonesia

2018 - 2022

